          {/* 🚀 CRITICAL FIX: Short, punchy, and highly scannable testimonial */}
          <h1 className="text-4xl font-black leading-tight mb-8">
            "Flawless formatting. The AI tailored my bullets perfectly and my callback rate doubled."
